 "text": "-->\nList of County Offices | deuelcountysd\ntop of page\nSkip to Main Content\nWelcome to Deuel County, South Dakota\nHOME\nDeuel County Commissioners\n2026 Commissioner Meetings\nArchived Commissioner Meeting Minutes\nList of County Offices\nAuditor\nClerk of Courts\nCommunity Health Nurse\nDirector of Equalization\nEmergency Management\n4-H Youth Program\nHighway Dept.\nICAP\nPlanning and Zoning\n2026 Zoning Meetings\nArchived Zoning Board Minutes\nRegister of Deeds\nSheriff's Office\nState's Attorney\nTreasurer\nVeterans Service Officer\nWeed Supervisor\nContact/More info\nCounty Job Opening\nCourthouse History\nTown & Township Contact Information\nMore\nUse tab to navigate through the menu items.\nClick on the county office heading to go directly to that page.\nAuditor\ncounty business manager, voter registration, tax levies\n​\nClerk of Courts\nmaintains the official files on all cases brought before the court.\n​\nDirector of Equalization\nassess all real property in the county for property tax purposes.\nEmergency Management\nplans for and manages disasters\n​\n4-H Youth Program\n4-H information\n​\nHighway Department\nconstructing, maintaining and repairing county roads and bridges\n​\nICAP\nprovide resourceful assistance to qualifying persons in cooperation with other agencies\n​\n​\n​\nPlanning and Zoning\npermits for all structures, shelterbelts, fireworks and concentrated animal feeding operations.\n​\nRegister of Deeds\nissues and files marriage licenses, birth and death certificates, burial permits, real estate transactions, deed filing\n​\nSheriff's Office\nassures that all the laws of the state are executed and enforced\n​\nState's Attorney\ncounty legal affairs\n​\nTreasurer\ncollector of taxes,vehicle registration\nVeterans Service Officer\nassist veterans and their families in accessing benefits\n​\nWeed Supervision\nenforces county and state noxious weed laws\n​\n​\nClick here to\ngo HOME .\nCourthouse hours\n8:00 a.m. -5:00 p.m.\nClosed weekends and\nall state and federal holidays\n​\nCourthouse address\n408 4th Street West\nClear Lake, SD 57226\n© 2018 by Deuel County Proudly created with Wix.com\nPlease contact the specific office with your questions or concerns by clicking on the CONTACT US link below.\n​\nCONTACT US\nbottom of page",
